- Story & Context: The last train of the cycle arrives at the phantom stop of Oara, only to find the station entirely submerged and abandoned by all but the drifting debris. The rhythmic clatter of the train wheels slowly transitions into the slow, steady heartbeat of the canal, marking the end of the current epoch. "Nothing remains but the schedule you failed to keep," echoes through the empty, waterlogged tunnels.
